      "side": 1,
      "message": "I realize I\u0027m 2.5 years late on this, but I don\u0027t see how that second stacktrace happens. (Maybe Gerrit lost some indentation over the years?)\n```\nSkAndroidCodec\ngetAndroidPixels\n  handleFrameIndex (androidCodec \u003d this SkAndroidCodec)\n    getAndroidPixels // possibly - to decode prior frame\n      handleFrameIndex (androidCodec \u003d this SkAndroidCodec again)\n        SkCodec-\u003egetPixels // How does this get called if androidCodec is non-null?\n```\nFrom what I can tell, the call flow should be something like\n\n```\nSkAndroidCodec\ngetAndroidPixels\n  handleFrameIndex (androidCodec \u003d this SkAndroidCodec)\n    getAndroidPixels // possibly - to decode prior frame\n      handleFrameIndex (androidCodec \u003d this SkAndroidCodec again)\n        return kSuccess bc fAndroidCodecHandlesFrameIndex \u003d true\n      return something (presume kSuccess)\n    FrameHolder-\u003egetFrame(requiredFrame)\n    return something (presume kSuccess)\n  onGetAndroidPixels()\n    SkCodec-\u003egetPixels\n       handleFrameIndex (androidCodec \u003d nullptr)\n    return kSuccess bc fAndroidCodecHandlesFrameIndex \u003d true\n  return something\n```\nRight?",
